.SH NAME
SystemEx.Device.Memory.DeviceBuffer \- Represents a cache that can be shared with a hardware backend through \fBDeviceSharedBuffer<TDeviceSharedBackend>\fP\&. 
.br
 A \fBDeviceBuffer\fP behaves like a normal \fBCache\fP, but supports locking and shared‑memory synchronization for device kernels\&.  

